mapping "V0104.1" source="V0104" target="215142005" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V0104 (Swedish extension of V01.0) = Pedestrian injured in collision with bicycle,
        nontraffic accident, during vital activity (rest/sleep/meal/personal hygiene). Parent ICD-10
        V01.0 (Pedestrian injured in collision with pedal cycle, nontraffic accident) has Athena SNOMED
        215142005 crosswalk to SNOMED CT 442247 (Pedal cycle accident involving collision between pedal
        cycle and pedestrian, pedestrian injured, concept_code 215142005). Swedish code adds
        activity-context detail not in target. Target subsumes source. broader.
        """
}
